Source: scenefx
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkg-config,
 libwayland-dev, libwayland-bin, wayland-protocols (>= 1.41),
 libdrm-dev, libxkbcommon-dev, libpixman-1-dev,
 libwlroots-0.20-dev (>= 0.20),
 libgbm-dev, libegl-dev, libgles-dev, liblcms2-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/wlrfx/scenefx

Package: scenefx
Architecture: amd64
# Combined lib+dev: scenefx-0.5.pc Requires.private (wlroots-0.20,
# wayland-server, libdrm, xkbcommon, pixman-1, egl, gbm, glesv2, lcms2)
# must resolve for consumer builds; the wlroots-0.20.pc closure in turn
# rides on the distro's libwlroots-0.20-dev package.
# wlroots comes from the distro (libwlroots-0.20 / -dev), NOT from this
# repo: it ships the same SONAME and would collide on libwlroots-0.20.so.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwlroots-0.20 (>= 0.20),
 libwayland-dev, libdrm-dev, libxkbcommon-dev, libpixman-1-dev,
 libegl-dev, libgbm-dev, libgles-dev, liblcms2-dev
Description: Wayland compositor effects library (for wlroots 0.20)
 scenefx provides blur, shadow and animation effects for
 wlroots-based compositors. Built against the distro's wlroots
 0.20 (libwlroots-0.20-dev).
